WEBVTT

00:19:59.125 --> 00:20:00.565
SRK: Thank you so much.

00:20:00.565 --> 00:20:04.995
Absolutely wonderful, inspiring
and thank you so much

00:20:04.995 --> 00:20:07.494
for taking time out 
and being here amidst us.

00:20:07.494 --> 00:20:10.084
Ladies and Gentlemen, 
the biggest round of applause,

00:20:10.084 --> 00:20:13.434
for the one and only, Mr. Sundar Pichai.

00:20:13.477 --> 00:20:15.233
Thank you very much, Sir.